  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "When nobleman Lee Jung gets kicked out for defying his father's orders, he wanders until he meets the orphan Kwon Chan-Soo. Bewitched by Chan-Soo's resemblance to his first love, Jung finds himself drawn into Chan-Soo's world. But there's more to this orphan than meets the eye, and Jung is intrigued by the mysteries of it all. Will Jung figure out what he truly wants from life, or will Chan-Soo's many secrets trap him in a situation he can't escape from?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
